===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{mythology}} The Roman [[goddess]] of [[agriculture]]; equivalent to the [[Greek]] goddess [[Demeter]].
# {{planet}} A celestial body [[orbit]]ing between [[Mars]] and [[Jupiter]]; previously defined as an [[asteroid]]; now officially known as a [[dwarf planet]]; officially called '''1 Ceres'''.

